WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.380
I have some exciting news.

2
00:00:01.380 --> 00:00:02.653
Is everybody ready?

3
00:00:03.910 --> 00:00:06.750
Okay. So women's wear Daily,

4
00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:10.040
just announced a brand new lifestyle magazine

5
00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:13.370
that will hit shelves on June 14th.

6
00:00:13.370 --> 00:00:16.599
And guess what it's called?

7
00:00:16.599 --> 00:00:19.682
(audience murmuring)

8
00:00:20.737 --> 00:00:22.070
Its called Drew!

9
00:00:23.149 --> 00:00:26.066
(audience applaud)

10
00:00:27.062 --> 00:00:28.928
Yap. That's it.

11
00:00:28.928 --> 00:00:31.095
It's just Drew. That's it.

12
00:00:31.930 --> 00:00:33.630 line:15%
And listen,

13
00:00:33.630 --> 00:00:36.740 line:15%
I, this has been my dream,

14
00:00:36.740 --> 00:00:39.300 line:15%
honestly since I was a pre teenager,

15
00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:43.740
ripping out tear sheets from every magazine imaginable

16
00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:48.070
to create my very own wallpaper of imagery.

17
00:00:48.070 --> 00:00:50.440
Look that's me at 12 years old.

18
00:00:50.440 --> 00:00:51.890
Why I'm holding barbells?

19
00:00:51.890 --> 00:00:53.400
I don't know. (audience laughs)

20
00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:54.830
But if you take a look

21
00:00:54.830 --> 00:00:58.780
at the wall behind me, my floor to ceiling,

22
00:00:58.780 --> 00:01:02.890
wall to wall was nothing but tear sheets.

23
00:01:02.890 --> 00:01:06.520
Magazines have just been really important to me.

24
00:01:06.520 --> 00:01:07.980
And our magazine will cover some

25
00:01:07.980 --> 00:01:09.820
of the things we talk about here on the show.

26
00:01:09.820 --> 00:01:14.240
And more beauty, food, travel, inspiring stories and people.

27
00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:17.920
And of course, news, and I hope this little collection

28
00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:19.860
of pages brings you joy

29
00:01:19.860 --> 00:01:22.660
and provides some escape from everyday life.

30
00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:24.810
Maybe a little how to get into everyday life

31
00:01:24.810 --> 00:01:26.310
at the same time.

32
00:01:26.310 --> 00:01:31.060
And help us see beauty, everywhere that we look.

33
00:01:31.060 --> 00:01:35.090
And the first issue will drop nationally in newsstands.

34
00:01:35.090 --> 00:01:36.570
That's right, baby.

35
00:01:36.570 --> 00:01:40.360
This is all paper. (audience applaud)

36
00:01:40.360 --> 00:01:41.890
There'll be a digital landing page,

37
00:01:41.890 --> 00:01:43.680
if you wanna look, it's a few images

38
00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:46.450
it'll give you a little whiff of what we're doing

39
00:01:46.450 --> 00:01:48.350
but I'm kicking it old school.

40
00:01:48.350 --> 00:01:50.190
Because magazines have been

41
00:01:50.190 --> 00:01:53.570
one of the greatest influences in my life.

42
00:01:53.570 --> 00:01:55.680
And the fact that I can look back

43
00:01:55.680 --> 00:01:59.010
on my 12 year old self and tell her that she's the founder

44
00:01:59.010 --> 00:02:04.010
of a new magazine is such a good feeling. (Audience applaud)

45
00:02:04.434 --> 00:02:07.180
And it's just very full circle. (applaud continues)

46
00:02:07.180 --> 00:02:10.070
And I'm so excited, I can't wait to share it with you

47
00:02:10.070 --> 00:02:13.210
everything I do is about putting it out there.

48
00:02:13.210 --> 00:02:15.180
We have to create it, but it's not for us.

49
00:02:15.180 --> 00:02:16.370
It's to put out.

50
00:02:16.370 --> 00:02:18.953
(upbeat music)

